   "width": 390,
   "message": "2 headline(s) wrap past two lines at 390px: \"I DON'T JUST USE SYSTEMS. I LEARN HOW THEY FAIL.\" → 4 lines (10 words, 26px); \"Quizzes, toolkit, challenges & your dashboard li\" → 3 lines (9 words, 22px)",
   "fix": "Cut words first (a headline is a title, not a sentence). Then give it a wider measure. Lower the size only as a last resort and never below the scale you chose. A real statement paragraph belongs in a <p> or <blockquote> at 24px or less."
  },
